      "t": "In this scene focused on plans for the evening, The characters discuss their situation. I'm so sorry. I didn't mean to. Let's listen closely to Chef Viktor and Elena's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
